	Section:
		Text: Typography
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Font and size
		Paragraph: There is no default font: every text needs a `Font` and a `Size`, its own or inherited. The font is named by its family, as its files declare it. This server has IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Serif and IBM Plex Mono.
			Style: intro
		Text: Font: IBM Plex Sans
			Style: label
		Text: Walnut chairs, oak tables and wool cushions.
